OL,3,GNEWSAPriest appointed to smallest      
OL,4,Aparish                                 
OL,6,FA new priest has been appointed to     
OL,7,FGuernsey's smallest parish.            
OL,9,FThe Reverend Juliette Robilliard will  
OL,10,Fbe formally licensed as                
OL,11,Fpriest-in-charge of Torteval at a      
OL,12,Fspecial service in December.           
OL,14,FShe started worshipping in the church  
OL,15,Fin 1977, served as a lay reader there  
OL,16,Fand was appointed as the first female  
OL,17,Fconstable in the parish in 1985.       
OL,19,FRobilliard worked for a clearing bank  
OL,20,Ffor 22 years before joining the        
OL,21,FGuernsey Financial Services Commission 
OL,22,Fwhere she worked for 20 years.         
